<title>CHINA: Soccer-Standings in China's professional league.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Standings in China's professional league.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings after the 16th round of matches of China's professional soccer league (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Dalian Wanda	 16  10   6   0   34   12   36</p>
<p> Guangzhou Apollo   15   7   6   2   22   14   27</p>
<p> Shanghai Shenhua   15   6   8   1   28   16   26</p>
<p> Chinese Army	 16   5  10   1   20   12   25</p>
<p> Beijing Guo'an     16   6   5   5   25   21   23</p>
<p> Guangdong Hongyuan 16   4  10   2   16   14   22</p>
<p> Jinan Taishan	16   5   5   6   18   20   20</p>
<p> Sichuan Quanxin    16   4   6   6   15   20   18</p>
<p> Tianjin Samsung    16   3   7   6   13   24   16</p>
<p> Shenzhen	     16   2   5   9    8   21   11</p>
<p> Yanbian Hyundai    16   2   5   9   11   25   11</p>
<p> Guangzhou Songri   16   1   7   8    7   18   10</p>
